   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 2</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Ranged Weapons</p>\n<p><em>“Make sure to rev it down before shovin’ it back in your pants.”</em></p>\n<p>While wielded in two hands, the weapon may also be used as an IMI Chainknife (DL:12Gun, pg. 3). When revved, the Chainknife Underbarrel remains so while the primary weapon is wielded, and must be revved down as an Action before the primary weapon can be safely stowed. While installed, the weapon is no longer Concealable.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 2</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Underbarrel Equipment).</em></p>"
